    "pc_requirements": {
        "minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 or 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 11th gen Intel\u00ae Core\u2122 i5, AMD 3000-series Ryzen\u2122 5, or similar<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel\u00ae Iris\u00ae X\u1d49 Graphics or similar integrated graphics<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Minimum specs work for most features, but simultaneous drawing with a high line count (more than 16 lines in parallel) may cause stuttering. Additionally, WebM video exports are slow with minimum specs, switch to AVI for faster exports at the expense of disk space usage.</li></ul>",
        "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 or 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 13th gen Intel\u00ae Core\u2122 i5, AMD 7000-series Ryzen\u2122 5, or similar<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Recent NVIDIA or AMD dedicated graphics card (e.g. NVIDIA RTX\u2122 3060 Ti) with at least 4 GB vRAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 4 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Most MIDI keyboards are supported for additional piano-style input. (Limited keyboard piano functionality is also available.)<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Pressure-sensitive drawing supported with a game controller or a drawing tablet (e.g. Wacom).</li></ul>"
    },
